      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267107/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Arrange zucchini slices in a single layer in the air fryer basket, working in batches if necessary.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M7IoigLMe6p3POg3HJHrFBbirJE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/267107-AirFryerZucchiniChips-mfs-Step3-3506-cc883600dbb340f5abe6a7dc4442a559.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/267107/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer for 10 minutes; flip the slices and cook 2 minutes more. Repeat with remaining zucchini slices.",
